336
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,060
可我还想吃
but I can't stop.

337
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:29,440
你不一定非要吃啊
You don't have to eat it.

338
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,920
说什么鬼话
Are you crazy?

339
00:15:31,340 --> 00:15:33,600
这可是一生难得吃一次的美味酱汁
This is a once in a lifetime sauce.

340
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:37,380
我要把我的塑身衣撑到最大
I'm gonna push my Spanx to the limit.

341
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,920
有人愿意跟我换一下座位吗
Could someone switch seats with me?

342
00:15:41,380 --> 00:15:42,420
怎么回事 丹妮斯
What's going on over there, Denise?

343
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:43,700
你是不是又对别人毛手毛脚了
You keeping your hands to yourself?

344
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:45,700
那我坐她旁边好了
Uh, I'll sit next to her.

345
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,700
我想过去坐在卡洛琳旁边
I'd like to move down and sit next to Caroline.

346
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:50,460
所以现在你不想坐在你妈旁边了吗
Oh, so now you don't want to sit next to your mother?

347
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,400
反正我也不饿
I'm not hungry anyway.

348
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:56,120
我要上楼洗澡了
I'm gonna go upstairs and take a shower.

349
00:15:57,880 --> 00:16:00,540
我们家的浴帘有一个大洞哦
There's a big hole in our shower curtain.

350
00:16:01,540 --> 00:16:04,480
谢谢邀请 但我只用一款医生处方的肥皂
Thanks, but I use a doctor-prescribed soap.

351
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,620
多谢"帮忙"啊 阿憨
Thanks a lot, Han.

352
00:16:06,620 --> 00:16:08,620
你就不能为了我去跟她洗个鸳鸯浴吗
You couldn't just take a shower with her for me?

353
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,080
妈 我的那份呢
Ma! Where's my plate?

354
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,560
谁能帮忙拿份面上去给克丽斯
Could somebody take a plate up to Chrissy?

355
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:15,880
她还是很伤心不愿意出房门
She's still too upset to come out.

356
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,960
-你们也知道是因为... -我们知道 妈
- You know, because of-- - We know, Ma.

357
00:16:17,980 --> 00:16:18,980
我去吧
I'll do it.

358
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,700
因为我压根不喜欢这酱汁
'Cause I--I don't even like this sauce.

359
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:25,300
不 我给克丽斯送上去好了
No, I'll--I'll bring Chrissy her plate.

360
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:28,460
她是我最后的机会
She's my last chance.

361
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,600
帮我留点那个酱汁
And save me some of that sauce.

362
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,920
那是我吃过最好吃的东西
It's the best thing I've ever had.

363
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:32,720
别担心 我会帮你装满你的包包
Don't worry, I filled your purse with it.

364
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:38,440
没有人干活的吗
Does anyone work here?

365
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:39,780
我的食物呢
Where's my food?

366
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,400
哎哟哟 杰西卡
Well, well, well, Jessica.

367
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,300
你或许会做很棒的酱汁
You may make a great sauce,

368
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:47,720
但你阻止不了我
but you can't stop me.

369
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:52,700
发生什么事了
What's going on out there?

370
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:53,694
我听到有东西打碎了
I heard a crash!

371
00:16:53,694 --> 00:16:56,060
啥事都没有
Uh, everything's fine!

372
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:57,740
外面有辆卡车撞了个小孩
A truck hit a kid outside.

373
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:00,440
麦克斯 你能过来一下吗
Max, can you come here for a second?

374
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,960
刚才那阵骚动是什么
What's all the commotion?

375
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:05,200
如果没食物 让我怎么消化我的情绪啊
I can't eat my frickin' feelings if there's no food!

376
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:07,540
撞的是骑自行车的小孩吗
Was the kid on a bike?

377
00:17:08,020 --> 00:17:11,740
天啊 你对杰西卡做了什么
Oh, my God! Look what you did to Jessica!

378
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:14,420
你为什么这么嫉妒她 卡洛琳
Why are you so jealous of her, Caroline?

379
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:16,700
你永远也当不了杰西卡好吗 我们谁都不行
You'll never be Jessica, okay? None of us will!

380
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,460
不是我干的
I didn't do it!

381
00:17:18,460 --> 00:17:19,860
她自己从墙上掉下来
She just fell off the wall.

382
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,060
麦克斯 她想害死我
Max, she is trying to destroy me.

383
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,020
老娘的食物呢
Where's my food?

384
00:17:24,220 --> 00:17:26,680
我又要开始狂挠胳膊了啊
I'm starting to scratch my arms again!

385
00:17:26,980 --> 00:17:28,380
好吧 我来搞定照片
Okay, I'll fix the picture.

386
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,120
把我这盘给她吧
Give her my plate.

387
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:30,940
等等
Hang on.

388
00:17:31,580 --> 00:17:33,080
让我再多吃一大口
Let me just take one more big bite.

389
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:34,720
也让我吃点
Give me a little of that.

390
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,340
去你妈的 杰西卡
Oh, damn you, Jessica!

391
00:17:45,300 --> 00:17:47,360
麦克斯 你是怎么弄好杰西卡的照片的
Max, how did you fix Jessica's picture?

392
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:48,540
看起来简直完美
It looks perfect!

393
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:49,880
不太容易
Wasn't easy.

394
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,860
我尽量避免跟她有眼神接触
I tried not to make eye contact with her,

395
00:17:51,940 --> 00:17:53,300
因为我开始对她有感情了
'cause I was starting to get feelings.

396
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:55,340
你在这儿啊
Hey, there you are.

397
00:17:55,660 --> 00:17:57,860
你还好吗 我知道我的家人很难相处
Are you okay? I know my family can be a lot.

398
00:17:58,420 --> 00:18:00,620
没有啦 我待得很开心
No, I'm having a great time.

399
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:02,800
你觉得你妈需要人帮忙把马卡龙拿出来吗
You think your mom needs help putting out that macaron?

400
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:05,020
我注意到她还没拆包装
I noticed they're not out.

401
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,500
我还注意到有一个在鸟笼里
I also noticed one in the birdcage.

402
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:09,980
如果你待得不开心
You know what? If you're not having a good time,

403
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:10,900
我们随时可以走
we can leave.

404
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:13,010
我是一个成年人 不用总听妈妈的话
I'm a grown man. She's not the boss of me.

405
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:16,327
-鲍比 -马上来 妈
- Bobby! - Coming, Ma!

406
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:19,080
卡洛琳 放轻松
Caroline, relax.

407
00:18:19,380 --> 00:18:20,900
没人会立刻喜欢上你
Nobody likes you right away.

408
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,960
我是一直到去年才喜欢上
I just got there last year,

409
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,460
而且直到现在感情还很多雷区
and there's still a lot of red flags.

410
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:32,160
谢谢你借我穿丹妮斯的毛毯袍
Thank you for letting me borrow Denise's Snuggie.

411
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:35,280
感觉我又回到我妈子宫里了呢
I feel like I'm back in the womb again.

412
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,774
不过这"子宫"里没有满是烟味
But it doesn't reek of cigarettes.

413
00:18:37,774 --> 00:18:39,167
等等
Wait.

414
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:41,600
好像有烟味
I think it does.

415
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:44,340
我喜欢
I like it.

416
00:18:44,540 --> 00:18:46,980
今晚这件衣服脱在地上时 我会更喜欢
I'm gonna like it even more when it's on the floor tonight.

417
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,060
那人还有气儿吗
Is that one still breathing?

418
00:18:53,384 --> 00:18:56,242
好啦 妈 我要去练空手道啦
All right, Ma, I'm going to karate.

419
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:57,640
空手道吗
Karate?

420
00:18:58,620 --> 00:18:59,475
哎哟哟
Well, well, well.

421
00:18:59,475 --> 00:19:01,800
跆拳道向你问好
Tae Kwon Hello.

422
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:03,460
我还是个黄带[基础]呢
I happen to be a yellow belt.

423
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,700
是吗
Oh, yeah?

424
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,280
是的
Oh, yeah.

425
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:11,980
我从鸟笼里拿出了五个马卡龙
I got five of the macaron back from the birdcage.

426
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:15,340
我明天把毛毯袍还给你
I'll get your Snuggie back to you by tomorrow.

427
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,500
明早鲍比从卡洛琳家走
I'll give to Bobby in the morning

428
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:19,140
我就顺便把袍子给他
when he leaves Caroline's.

429
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:23,780
你不是说你在布莱恩家睡吗
You said you slept at Brian's.

430
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:25,400
你现在开始骗我了吗
You lying to me now?

431
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:26,180
妈
Ma...

432
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:29,120
我昨晚在卡洛琳家过夜
I was with Caroline last night.

433
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:31,340
但我没看到他的裸体
But I didn't see him naked.

434
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:33,960
我看到了 我们浴室的门不能锁
I did. Our bathroom door doesn't lock.

435
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,060
我看出他为啥是你最爱的孩子了 太太
I see why he's your favorite, Mrs. F.

436
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:39,580
我们在看东西
Uh, we're watching something.

437
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,620
你们能不能去其他地方说话
Can you two talk somewhere else?

438
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:44,480
没关系啦 我开大声点
It's fine. I'll turn it up.

439
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:45,420
遥 遥控器在哪里
Where--where's the remote?

440
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:49,620
妈 我会订了要跟人家订婚
Whoa, Ma, I--I only got engaged to be engaged

441
00:19:49,780 --> 00:19:51,660
纯粹是因为爸爸生病 我希望你开心点
'cause Dad was sick, and I wanted you to be happy.

442
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:53,960
可现在我跟卡洛琳在一起了
But now I'm with Caroline, and...

443
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:55,562
而她让我很快乐
Caroline makes me happy.

444
00:19:55,562 --> 00:19:57,660
-我有吗 -她有吗
- I do? - She does?

445
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:58,880
有啊
You do.

446
00:19:59,220 --> 00:20:00,000
她有的
She does.

447
00:20:03,598 --> 00:20:07,280
-好啦 是... -是上天的旨意
- Okay, it was-- - Uh, it was a sign...

448
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:10,840
或许杰西卡不应该再被挂在那里了
that Jessica didn't belong there anymore.

449
00:20:12,300 --> 00:20:15,500
其实呢 你给我的鲍比带来笑容
You know what? You make my Bobby smile.

450
00:20:15,620 --> 00:20:17,800
而他笑的时候比平常更帅了
And he's even more handsome when he smiles.

451
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:20,240
克丽斯 下楼来见卡洛琳
Chrissy, come down and meet Caroline!

452
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:23,340
她正点吗 我最讨厌丑逼了 妈
She hot? Cause I don't like uggos, Ma.

453
00:20:23,860 --> 00:20:25,040
她美呆了
She's gorgeous.

454
00:20:25,820 --> 00:20:27,160
她长得像我
She looks like me.

455
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:29,040
除了比我多了点胡子
Just with a little more mustache.

456
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:32,652
欢迎来到我们家 姑娘们
Welcome to our home, girls.

457
00:20:32,652 --> 00:20:34,520
-谢谢 -谢谢
- Oh, thank you! - Thank you!

458
00:20:34,520 --> 00:20:37,400
你都不知道这对我有多大意义
You have no idea how much this means to me!

459
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:41,820
你试试挣脱我这固定术
Try and get out of this hold.

460
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:43,980
谁告诉你我想挣脱了
Who says I want to?

461
00:20:45,980 --> 00:20:47,540
下周日同一时间见吗
So same time next Sunday?
